<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 18-21.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 18-21.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 18-21. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		July 18-21	July 17/18</p>
<p>    CZK    0.41791	     0.41809</p>
<p>    DKK    2.09997	     2.09951</p>
<p>    FIM    2.70637	     2.71112</p>
<p>    GBP   23.9955	     24.03873</p>
<p>    HUF    0.0745		0.07461</p>
<p>    LTL    3.58624	     3.59532</p>
<p>    LVL   24.90934	    24.94456</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00248	     0.00248</p>
<p>    SEK    1.84363	     1.84235</p>
<p>    UAH    7.72926	     7.74925</p>
<p>    USD   14.3428	     14.3768</p>
<p>    XEU   15.78784	    15.79651</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
